{
  "id": "lp.review",
  "internal": true,
  "name": {
    "en": "Review (read-only)",
    "ru": "Ревью (только чтение)"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Multi-dimension code review of a diff, PR or file set with a thresholded verdict computed by code.",
    "ru": "Многомерное ревью диффа, PR или набора файлов; вердикт считается кодом по порогам."
  },
  "inputs": {
    "range": {
      "type": "string|string[]",
      "note": "диапазон коммитов или список коммитов"
    },
    "pr": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "files": {
      "type": "string[]"
    },
    "dimensions": {
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": true
    },
    "criteria": {
      "type": "any",
      "note": "строки acceptance или Goal[]"
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "status": "pass|rework|block",
    "warn": "bool",
    "critical_count": "int",
    "high_count": "int",
    "remaining_actionable": "int",
    "findings": "Finding[]",
    "verdict": "Verdict"
  },
  "entry": "scope",
  "budget": {
    "max_steps": 14,
    "max_minutes": 50,
    "max_fan_out": 6
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "git.diff_files",
      "out": {
        "files": "string[]",
        "count": "int",
        "level": "quick|standard|deep"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "spec_check",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "code-critic",
      "applicable_modes": [
        "standard",
        "full"
      ],
      "skip_out": {
        "unmet_count": 0,
        "partial_count": 0,
        "criteria": "[]"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:workflows/review.md (step 0)",
      "prompt": "For each acceptance criterion find the function, endpoint or file that satisfies it; MET, PARTIAL (finding high) or UNMET (finding critical, dimension spec-compliance), with file:line.",
      "out": {
        "unmet_count": "int",
        "partial_count": "int",
        "criteria": "Criterion[]"
      },
      "guards": {
        "timeoutMin": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dims",
      "type": "parallel",
      "for_each": "$inputs.dimensions",
      "max_fan_out": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Review per dimension",
        "ru": "Ревью по измерению"
      },
      "child": {
        "type": "agent",
        "role": "code-critic",
        "session": "new",
        "src": "maestro-flow:workflows/review.md, odyssey-security.md, odyssey-defensive.md",
        "prompt": "CODE_CRITIC_METHOD for exactly one dimension ({{item}}). Every finding has file:line, severity, evidence (quoted code), impact, suggestion; severity is not softened without new evidence.\nsecurity: OWASP A01-A10, dependencies, secrets (report by location, never the value), a false positive is closed only with counter-evidence.\nsilent_failures: swallowed exceptions, defaults that hide an error, log-only handlers - does the caller learn about the failure?\nDo not report what a prior review already closed.\n",
        "out": {
          "dimension": "string",
          "findings": "Finding[]"
        }
      },
      "join": {
        "policy": "all",
        "out": {
          "findings": "Finding[]",
          "critical_count": "int",
          "high_count": "int",
          "unchecked": "string[]"
        },
        "uses": "reduce.lp.review.dims"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm",
      "type": "parallel",
      "for_each": "dims.findings where severity in [critical, high]",
      "applicable_modes": [
        "standard",
        "full"
      ],
      "max_fan_out": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Majority check (2 of 3)",
        "ru": "Проверка большинством (2 из 3)"
      },
      "src": "maestro-flow:workflows/swarm/wf-review (2 of 3)",
      "child": {
        "type": "agent",
        "role": "code-critic",
        "session": "new",
        "prompt": "Three independent critics each confirm or reject ONE finding from the code at file:line; mechanical majority decides. A rejection needs counter-evidence.",
        "votes": 3,
        "out": {
          "finding_id": "string",
          "confirmed": "bool"
        }
      },
      "join": {
        "policy": "majority",
        "out": {
          "confirmed_ids": "string[]",
          "dropped_ids": "string[]"
        },
        "uses": "reduce.lp.review.confirm"
      },
      "skip_when": "dims.critical_count + dims.high_count == 0",
      "skip_out": {
        "confirmed_ids": "[]",
        "dropped_ids": "[]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aggregate",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "verdict.aggregate",
      "rules": "findings = dims.findings minus confirm.dropped_ids; a critical/high finding without file:line or evidence is demoted to medium (settleVerdict).\ncritical_count >= 1 or high_count > 5 or spec_check.unmet_count >= 1 -> status rework (Maestro BLOCK).\n1 <= high_count <= 5 -> status pass, warn true (Maestro WARN). none -> pass.\ndims.unchecked non-empty (a dimension could not run) -> status block with a message for the PM.\n",
      "out": {
        "status": "pass|rework|block",
        "warn": "bool",
        "critical_count": "int",
        "high_count": "int",
        "remaining_actionable": "int",
        "findings": "Finding[]",
        "verdict": "Verdict"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "aggregate.status",
        "warn": "aggregate.warn",
        "critical_count": "aggregate.critical_count",
        "high_count": "aggregate.high_count",
        "remaining_actionable": "aggregate.remaining_actionable",
        "findings": "aggregate.findings",
        "verdict": "aggregate.verdict"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nothing",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "pass",
        "warn": false,
        "critical_count": 0,
        "high_count": 0,
        "remaining_actionable": 0,
        "findings": "[]"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "scope",
      "to": "nothing",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "scope.count == 0"
    },
    {
      "from": "scope",
      "to": "spec_check",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "when": "$mode != 'quick'"
    },
    {
      "from": "scope",
      "to": "dims",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "spec_check",
      "to": "dims",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "dims",
      "to": "confirm",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "confirm",
      "to": "aggregate",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "aggregate",
      "to": "result",
      "pass": "artifact"
    }
  ]
}
